ure><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This is a disambiguation page, which links to ambiguously named articles. If you were <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Oil_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Oil (disambiguation)\">brought here</a> by a link in an article, consider editing it to direct towards the intended page instead.</div></td></tr></tbody></table> \n<p>An <b>oil</b> is a chemical substance which does not mix with water and is usually flammable. Several types of oils exist as <a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">coatings</a>, which can be applied to a weapons to grant various benefits. Some items can also be used to create oil <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surfaces</a>, which turn into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface when ignited.\n</p><p><b>Oil</b> may refer to:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Areas\">Areas</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oil\" title=\"Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Oil_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Oil_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Oil_surface_Icon.webp/45px-Oil_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Oil_surface_Icon.webp/60px-Oil_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Oil_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Oil_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Oil_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Oil\" title=\"Oil\">Oil</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Consumables\">Consumables</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coatings\">Coatings</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Coat_Arsonist%